#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
accumulator_engine.py — BetPredict v8 Accumulator Builder
=========================================================
Builds singles + multi-leg tickets from calibrated v6 signals, targeting
combined-odds bands (including 50–100+ longshots) with quality-aware filters.
Complements smart_accumulator.py (Superbet-only executable pool).

Honesty rules:
  - No fake accuracy / guaranteed profit claims.
  - Longshot tickets are paper_only / lottery — variance destroys EV.
  - Prefer Superbet live odds when matched; otherwise label best_odds as
    non-executable planning odds so the UI never implies you can place them.
  - When signals_v6 / signals are empty, fall back to consensus + Superbet
    (honestly labelled) so the UI is not blank; still urge Fetch Daily.

Filter bar (relaxed v8.1 — quality-aware, not reckless):
  1. grade A+/A, or B with strong consensus
  2. consensus ≥ 0.60 singles / ≥ 0.70 multi (TOTAL or PARTIAL+score)
  3. publication_eligible / adaptive PASS / market not performance-blocked
  4. calibrated_prob gates by band
  5. EV ≥ -0.03 for high-grade singles; ≥ 0 value multi; ≥ -0.02 paper longshot
  6. prefer historically non-negative ROI markets; hard-avoid under25/under35
  7. correlation control: 1 leg/event, ≤1 league/ticket for longshots

Outputs:
  data/accumulators.json          — canonical for UI / Actions
  data/claude_accumulators.json   — same schema so existing Accumulators UI works

Standalone:  python3 src/accumulator_engine.py
Dry-run:     python3 src/accumulator_engine.py --dry-run
"""
